# Spicetify generated/binaries (regenerate with `spicetify apply`; token files live here).
# `**/` makes these match inside every theme's spicetify component folder
# (e.g. bwzs/spicetify/.spicetify/…).
**/.spicetify/spicetify
**/.spicetify/globals.d.ts
**/.spicetify/css-map.json
**/.spicetify/jsHelper/
**/.spicetify/*.state
**/.spicetify/*.token
**/.spicetify/*.exe

# Nothing sensitive should ever end up in the repo, but just in case:
*~
*.swp
*.state